      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T15:00:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The intent of this commit is not for phosphor-user-manager to decide if IPMI is enabled or disabled. Just to conditionally include IPMI if the IPMI DISTRO_FEATURES flag is set since IPMI was originally hardcoded in.",
      "parentUuid": "07dba4b7_fcde8fc9",
      "range": {
