        "id": 1002630
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T08:18:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If a platform disables IPMI at the daemon level, the ipmi entry in predefinedGroups becomes inert anyway.\nSo I\u0027m not sure this change adds any real security value at the user-manager.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "4a43e6f3780c136f55e6aab1242853bad0099b86",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
